The vessel is a foreign vessel according to the plaintiff and flying the flag of Indonesia and the plaintiff is alleged to be informed by the vessel agents that the defendant vessel is likely to sail out of Haldia Port on 18.10.2024 .
Thus, the extreme urgency in the matter and Section 12 (a) of the Commercial Courts Act, 2015 may be dispensed with.
